{"updated":"2026-10-23T07:47:36.369Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Europe needs a war economy. Elsewhere, maradona death: Verdict in trial to be delivered on December 22. And 🇧🇷 Brazil: Why should you care about the country's elections?. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on Ukraine, at active conflict levels, though US, and Israel are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 1.3 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial up 1.9 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 4.5 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 47 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 7.0 near 191 km ENE of Nagqu, China. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.1,0.15,0.2,0.23,0.28,0.33,0.37,0.41,0.45,0.5,0.53,0.56,0.59,0.61,0.66,0.79,0.88,1.06,1.3,1.42,1.46,1.5,1.52,1.57,1.59,1.61,1.64,1.68,1.73,1.8,1.87,1.92,1.95,1.99,2.03,2.07,2.1,2.16,2.21,2.24,2.28,2.32,2.37,2.42,2.46,2.51,2.57,2.62,2.69,2.81,2.9,3.03,3.05,3.1,3.12,3.18,3.23,3.29,3.4,3.48,3.54,3.61,3.66,3.71,3.76,3.8,3.84,3.87,3.9,3.95,3.97,3.99,4.02,4.06,4.11,4.19,4.25,4.32,4.38,4.43,4.48,4.53,4.59,4.61,4.67,4.78,4.93,5.11,5.62,5.75,5.83,5.89,5.93,5.98,6.01,6.06,6.09,6.15,6.21,6.26,6.3,6.34,6.37,6.42,6.46,6.58,6.64,6.71,6.77,6.84,6.91,6.98,7.02,7.09,7.25,7.42,7.74,7.86,7.92,7.98,8.03,8.08,8.15,8.19,8.24,8.36,8.39,8.47,8.54,8.63,8.7,8.77,8.82,8.89,8.95,9.01,9.09,9.14,9.25,9.31,9.36,9.45,9.57,9.85,9.96,10.03,10.08,10.15,10.21,10.26,10.31,10.36,10.39,10.44,10.5,10.55,10.63,10.73,10.79,10.84,10.9,10.94,10.96,11.03,11.06,11.1,11.15,11.18,11.24,11.3,11.34,11.39,11.43,11.46,11.51,11.53,11.56,11.6,11.63,11.69,11.74,11.8,11.85,11.91,11.96,12.01,12.04,12.06,12.12,12.56,12.74,12.91,13.51,13.58,13.63,13.66,13.72,13.72,13.72,13.72,13.77,13.82,13.87,13.94,14.06,14.18,14.33,14.46,14.51,14.58,14.63,14.68,14.7,14.72,14